|i3 : I = minors(2, A) -- a birational map                           |
|                                                                    |
|             2       2    3    2    3    2                          |
|o3 = ideal (x y + x*y  + y  + x z, x , -x y)                        |
|                                                                    |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : gensSatSpecialFib I                                            |
|                                                                    |
|         2    3    2    2    3                                      |
|o4 = {x*y  + y  + x z, x y, x }                                     |
|                                                                    |
|o4 : List                                                           |
