|i5 : gensSatSpecialFib(I, 5)                                        |
|                                                                    |
|         2    3    2    2    3                                      |
|o5 = {x*y  + y  + x z, x y, x }                                     |
|                                                                    |
|o5 : List                                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : A = matrix{ {x^3, x^2 + y^2},                                  |
|                 {-y^3, y^2 + z*x},                                 |
|                 {0, x^2}                                           |
|               };                                                   |
|                                                                    |
|             3      2                                               |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : I = minors(2, A) -- a non birational map                       |
|                                                                    |
|             3 2    2 3    5    4    5    2 3                       |
