Hm1Rees0Strategy -- A strategy for degreeOfMap
**********************************************

Description
===========

When this strategy is used then the degree of the map is computed directly from
the multiplicity of $[H_m^1(Rees(I))]_0$. It contains an implementation of
Corollary 2.12 in Degree and birationality of multi-graded rational maps (see
https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.05180 ).

