SatSpecialFibStrategy -- A strategy for degreeOfMap
***************************************************

Description
===========

When this strategy is used then the degree of the map is computed directly from
the multiplicity of the saturated special fiber ring of $I$. The degree of the
rational map then can be obtained from Theorem 2.4 in Degree and birationality
of multi-graded rational maps (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.05180 ).

